  + ③ mergeable but the owner session died with the restart ⇒ owner-gone + task row failed; NO revival channel is invoked 0.358s
  + ④ no open members = zero-action sweep 0.196s
  + ⑤ mergeable + owner lost BUT the write-ahead channel holds an un-closed record ⇒ PRESERVED (window returned, task row untouched) — owner-gone suppressed by the channel premise (R5) 0.313s
  + ⑤b an already-merged member with a channel record but NO registry record ⇒ closed merged by fact-check (the channel premise never blocks the happy path) 0.344s
