nebflow.agent.InterruptRecoveryClosureSpec:
  + V4/checkpoint: revival writes a machine-readable completed-work ledger AND carries its readout into the revival nudge 0.356s
  + V5/finalize: completed ∧ workReport ∧ reportStatus 缺席 → boot leg closes it (work report to the parent mailbox) + idempotent 0.209s
  + V5/negative: work NOT finished (in-flight row) → revives, never finalized, no 'completed' notice to the parent 0.206s
  + D1/recap: a delivered restart-loss notice is restated AFTER compaction, and the retelling is bounded (≤2, then silent) 0.213s
  + D1/receipt(重写): the salvage leg terminalizes honestly — zero parent notify, zero ledger notice, the row says so 0.207s
