nebflow.agent.CompactionQueueStoreSpec:
  + save/load round-trip preserves every field (imms + events) 0.004s
  + ② human-origin bit survives 入队 ↔ 崩溃恢复 round-trip (fromUser) 0.001s
  + ② pre-② snapshot without the field decodes as fromUser=false (backward compatible) 0.002s
  + save of empty queues clears the file 0.001s
  + load of a missing file returns None 0.001s
  + load of a corrupt file returns None (warn, not crash) 0.002s
  + save/load with empty sessionId is a no-op 0.0s
  + legacy file missing imms/events decodes with empty defaults (forward compat) 0.002s
