nebflow.agent.StreamInactivitySupervisionSpec:
  + classify: stream-inactivity stall is Transient(Timeout) — upstream jitter, retryable 0.0s
  + classify: typed firstToken timeout stays Permanent — dead provider, fail fast 0.0s
  + classify: plain timeout message still Permanent (600s no-progress guard keeps strict path) 0.001s
  + retryable: typed StreamInactivityTimeout is retryable (clean-checkpoint re-send) 0.0s
  + retryable: exhausted chain of all-inactivity attempts is retryable 0.0s
  + retryable: exhausted chain mixing inactivity with a Permanent attempt is NOT retryable 0.0s
  + retryable: overload exhausted chain stays retryable (regression, 08-18 semantics) 0.0s
  + retryable red line: Auth/Format/context-overflow/firstToken-timeout Permanent errors stay zero-retry 0.001s
  + retryable: ToolPipelineError never retries (tool-chain issue, not provider condition) 0.0s
  + config: llm.streamTimeouts decodes and boots with Defaults on absence 0.001s
  + defaults: inactivity raised 60→120s (P3); firstToken/no-progress unchanged 0.0s
nebflow.agent.CacheWarmingSpec:
  + ⑨ role×state gate table: terminal/frozen/real-traffic/idle-main/fresh-leaf all forbid warming 0.003s
  + ⑨ gating candidates (waiting-child / long-wait-resume) pass the hard gate and reach the economics gate 0.001s
  + ⑩ known prices + positive value → shadow with explicit cost/saving (never a real send) 0.001s
  + ⑩ negative expected value (saving ≤ cost×(1+margin)) → no warming 0.0s
  + ⑩ unknown price or unknown TTL → shadow (never claims savings, never sends) 0.001s
  + ⑩ session warm-count cap → stop 0.0s
  + ⑩ maxWarmsPerSession = 0 is explicit warming-disabled → no warming 0.0s
  + ⑩ budget exhausted → stop 0.0s
  + ⑩ cumulative warming costlier than one cold read → reject 0.001s
  + ⑨ evaluate NEVER returns WarmSend for any role×state×economics (no sender exists in this batch) 0.001s
  + ⑩ builder skips when no safe small output cap / incompatible thinking budget; plan preserves prefix config 0.001s
  + ⑨ warming ledger is separate from business attribution (business totals untouched) 0.003s
