nebflow.agent.MailboxBootSweepSpec:
  + first boot seeds the epoch with an EMPTY window — no synthesis ever fires (pre-activation ledger untouched) 0.01s
  + terminal delegate row landed in the previous window, box empty ⇒ boot synthesizes a replace-entry 0.007s
  + consumed terminal (tombstone in delivered.json) is NOT re-synthesized 0.005s
  + entry already on disk (accounted) or parent session gone ⇒ zero action 0.003s
  + running rows and subtask rows never synthesize (delegate terminal states only) 0.003s
  + tmp fragments are swept by run (report.tmpSwept) 0.002s
  + second run in the SAME boot does not re-synthesize (window rolled past the row's completedAt) 0.004s
