nebflow.agent.DeferredCancelWireSpec:
  + D1/D2: a deferred stop lands the in-flight batch's tool_result BEFORE the actor stops, and no new turn follows 1.482s
  + D3: the historical Stop(reason) still tears the in-flight batch down immediately (zero regression) 0.689s
  + D4: Stop() on an idle session (no batch in flight) falls back to the immediate path 0.355s
nebflow.agent.InteractionRequestIdSpec:
  + ⑤ 正控：五个生成点都产出 `scope-<16 hex>`（随机段 ≥16 hex = ≥60 bit 熵） 0.001s
  + ⑤ 负控：旧口径形态（8 hex / 无作用域前缀）判据性变红——本判据确实能抓旧形态 0.0s
  + ⑤ 唯一性：20 万次生成（跨 5 个作用域）零重复 0.19s
  + ⑤ 冲突面：作用域前缀使跨类碰撞在结构上不可能（前缀互不为前缀） 0.004s
  + ⑤ scope 参数不抛异常（生成器不得成为新失败点） 0.001s
nebflow.agent.StuckDelegateReleaseSpec:
==> i nebflow.agent.StuckDelegateReleaseSpec.issue #31: stuck delegate releases the parent barrier — held results inject, root fires, no phantom ignored 0.0s
==> i nebflow.agent.StuckDelegateReleaseSpec.#418: idle parent + cross-turn twin delegates — first completion wakes the parent immediately ignored 0.0s
nebflow.agent.McpPermissionReplaySpec:
  + A1-5 mcpPermission 答复必需 approved:Boolean —— 形状不符不消费卡（生产 answerCompletes） 0.001s
  + A1-5(零回归) 既有两 kind 的形状判据逐条不变 0.0s
  + A1-5(答复解码) McpPermissionAnswer：approved 必需，scope/upgradeMode 可选 0.001s
  + A1-7 重连重放：mcpPermission 卡进快照（replayed 只读快照 + requestId 绑定） 0.0s
  + A1-7(只读 + root 过滤) 快照不改槽位；别的 root 不出现 0.001s
