  + SEC3(零回归): secret=false（显式或缺省）⇒ 载荷逐字节等于既有形态 0.0s
  + ON1: ownerName 在场 ⇒ 顶层落键（delegate 发起的 ask，段①=批次短名） 0.0s
  + ON2: 节点提问 ⇒ ownerName + nodeName 同帧（卡片渲染 delegate name · node name） 0.001s
  + ON3(零回归): ownerName 缺席/空串 ⇒ 不落键，载荷逐字节等于既有形态 0.0s
  + ON4: delegate 会话本人提问 ⇒ 取自己的批次短名 0.0s
  + ON5: 节点会话提问 ⇒ 取委托它的 delegate（rootSessionId 自根） 0.0s
  + ON6: Nebula 自问 / 项目分发器 / 无名旧记录 ⇒ None（前端回落项目名） 0.001s
  + ON7: 名字含首尾空白/纯空白 ⇒ trim；纯空白视同无名（不落键） 0.0s
nebflow.agent.MailboxDrainSpec:
  + barrierPlan: last sub-agent member arriving (outstanding == subRemaining) releases the batch 0.002s
  + barrierPlan: members still in flight (outstanding > subRemaining) HOLD sub-agent entries 0.001s
  + barrierPlan: full sub batch at exactly outstanding takes ALL 0.0s
  + barrierPlan: non-subagent entries (escalations etc.) are ALWAYS taken, sub sibling may hold 0.001s
  + barrierPlan: takes keep seq relative order (scheduling predicate never reorders) 0.001s
  + barrierPlan: empty box or zero outstanding defensive faces 0.001s
  + drainIdleFaceSync takes ALL pending, stamps viaMailbox, leaves taken/ as the carrier 0.006s
  + drainBarrierFaceSync returns (events, held) and holds entries untouched on disk 0.007s
  + takenSubagentSlots counts sub-agent events only — the take-time barrier accounting is exact-once 0.001s
  + replayTakenEventsSync re-injects taken residuals (crash window 3/4); unlink ends the replay 0.004s
  + mailboxHeldCount reads pending depth without consuming 0.003s
  + mailboxMessage: single event = direct-injection form with payload verbatim + source marker 0.001s
  + mailboxMessage: retryable failure carries the re-delegation hint 0.001s
  + mailboxMessage: many events = numbered reminder batch form 0.001s
