nebflow.agent.FreezeAlertWindowSpec:
  + merge key = one error-type family (reason-code family), never provider+model, never per-delegate 0.002s
  + provider-family freezes stay silent inside AND past the former horizon 0.0s
  + provider freezes of same and different families never create parent alerts (panel digest remains available) 1.704s
  + empirical (重写): a provider freeze sends ZERO messages both younger and older than the former 30-minute horizon 0.492s
  + rolling (重写): provider family remains silent on every tick, before and after the former merge window 2.095s
  + deterministic-defect still notifies immediately; provider family stays silent even after the former horizon (重写) 0.585s
  + panel digest retains provider freeze statistics without producing a parent alert (重写) 1.93s
  + production-default provider digest planning is silent; panel statistics and ledger remain readable (重写) 0.003s
nebflow.agent.SubAgentBarrierSpec:
  + isSubagentResult matches subtask and delegate sources only 0.002s
  + while the batch is outstanding, all subtask/delegate results are held 0.0s
  + while the batch is outstanding, a non-subagent event may still pass 0.0s
  + batch complete: ALL held subtask/delegate results drain together 0.001s
  + batch complete: non-subagent events keep the one-at-a-time drain 0.0s
  + single non-subagent event without a batch is drained as before 0.0s
  + compaction guard holds everything, barrier or not 0.001s
  + empty queue is a no-op 0.0s
  + countBarrierIncrements: ephemeral Delegate counts 0.0s
  + countBarrierIncrements: persistent Delegate does NOT count 0.0s
  + countBarrierIncrements: SubTask always counts 0.0s
  + countBarrierIncrements: failed spawns never count 0.0s
  + countBarrierIncrements: mixed batch counts only ephemeral successes 0.0s
