nebflow.agent.ManualRevivalSpec:
  + MR1: manual boot sweep saves state — in-flight orphan + queue-less ready-to-merge zombie → pending-recovery, zero revive, zero terminalize, zero upward notify 0.2s
  + MR2: a second boot does not disturb pending rows (idempotent save; never auto-terminalizes behind the user's back) 0.202s
  + MR3: restoreAll (panel 一键全部恢复) revives every eligible pending row in place — same id, resumed transcript, row back to running 0.214s
  + MR4: restoreOne — unknown id and non-restorable rows are refused with panel-readable reasons (no spawn attempted) 0.002s
  + MR5: recovery view = pending-recovery / frozen / restart-fingerprint failed rows; honest failed and completed rows stay out 0.001s
  + MR6: ManualRevivalHost is a one-slot assembly holder — install/current/reset, absent deps is a readable None (never an NPE) 0.0s
  + MR7: Defaults.RestartRecoveryManual defaults to manual (true); the system prop is the single rollback switch 0.0s
nebflow.agent.IdentityClauseSpec:
  + flag off renders nothing for every shape 0.001s
  + T1 strict block: machine-consumer audience, Pop ban, budget 0.0s
  + T1 userFacing variant: dual audience, no display ban, relaxed budget 0.0s
  + T2 team member block: Lead consumer + Mail/RESULT channels 0.0s
  + section wiring: renders via buildConditionalBlocks by category 0.001s
