nebflow.agent.OrphanDelegateRecoverySpec:
  + R1(重写): orphan sweep terminalizes with zero upward notify; partial result stays readable in the transcript 0.005s
  + R2(重写): sweep is idempotent across repeated runs (zero notify both times, no re-terminalize) 0.003s
  + R3: orphan whose parent session was deleted is terminalized without notification 0.003s
  + R4: AgentControl list shows orphan rows without a registry entry (join-free path) 0.194s
  + R5 RED BASELINE: with the sweep bypassed, the audited loss shape reproduces (task stuck running, no notification) 0.003s
  + R6 (重启对账): a 'restarting' (supervisor backoff) orphan is terminalized AND its registry row gets the restart-interrupted flag 0.004s
  + R7 (重启对账): fingerprint backfill flags historical restart-lost rows — skipped for reported/archived rows, idempotent on re-run 0.006s
