nebflow.agent.EscalationNotifyStormSpec:
  + STORM-1/2 (重写): provider failures never enter or notify escalation; recovery still closes cleanly 21.667s
  + STORM-2b: FreezeScheduler.scan throttles re-fire by bumping escalateAt forward 0.734s
  + STORM-3: coalesce replaces same-key escalation in place; keeps others verbatim 0.003s
  + STORM-4: gate admits up to cap per window, suppresses beyond, summary rides next admit 0.012s
nebflow.agent.DelegateSettleTargetSpec:
  + pickSettleTargets: 既有完成目标非空 ⇒ 原样返回（Mail / merge-turn / standby-care 腿逐字不变） 0.002s
  + pickSettleTargets: replyTo 缺席（base-moved 唤醒腿）⇒ 仍落到本会话监督者 0.001s
  + resolveSettleTargets: 无 replyTo 的 delegate 回合 ⇒ 目标 = supervisorRef，Completed 真抵达监督者 0.003s
  + resolveSettleTargets: 根会话 / 未注册会话 ⇒ 目标仍为空（无监督者不得凭空造一个） 0.0s
