nebflow.agent.AgentActorCompactionSpec:
  + fresh state allows compaction (failures = 0 < max = 3) 0.0s
  + state with failures = max - 1 still allows compaction 0.0s
  + state with failures = max blocks compaction 0.001s
  + state with failures > max blocks compaction 0.0s
  + state reset: copy with compactionFailures = 0 after success 0.0s
  + pendingCompaction field is preserved during state transitions 0.0s
  + AgentState no longer has pendingManualCompaction (compile-time check) 0.001s
  + manual compact success clears pendingCompaction and resets failures 0.0s
  + manual compact failure increments failures and clears pendingCompaction 0.0s
  + compaction success resets latestUsage to prevent re-trigger 0.001s
  + drainHead keeps the queue intact while a compaction job is pending 0.0s
  + drainHead consumes exactly the head once no compaction is pending 0.001s
  + drainHead on an empty queue is a no-op either way 0.0s
  + ToolsComplete drain mirrors the guard: save-phase turn leaves events queued 0.0s
  + CompactionComplete drains ONE held-back event after the summary is in place 0.0s
  + finishTurn zombie guard clears a surviving CompactionJob and lets events deliver 0.001s
  + finishTurnCont branch-3: empty pendingUserInputs must be tail-safe 0.0s
  + V2: mixed queues inject exactly ONE message per round, zero loss (imms + replyTo-free users + events) 0.002s
  + V2: per-message drain preserves arrival order across consecutive boundaries (禁 burst/保序) 0.0s
  + V2: barrier-held delegate results stay queued while the batch is outstanding 0.001s
  + V2: non-subagent events flush even while the batch is outstanding 0.0s
  + V2: only-deferred queue → appended empty, deferred preserved for head-forward 0.0s
  + V5: thinking-only Compact response fails compaction — no mail-reminder dead loop 1.725s
  + V2b: resume=true compaction drains a queued immediate input into the continuation turn 0.646s
  + V2-persist: enqueue writes the queue snapshot to disk immediately 0.486s
  + V2-recover: persisted queues replay at spawn and land in the compaction continuation 0.863s
  + 尾部保真: multi-round compaction keeps the last user instruction verbatim in the continuation 0.659s
