nebflow.agent.ExternalEventBlocksSpec:
  + EB-1 block-less events keep the single-reminder wording byte-identical 0.001s
  + EB-2 a block event upgrades the reminder to Right(blocks): numbered text then the blocks 0.001s
  + EB-2b a retryable-failure hint rides the per-event numbered line inside the block path too 0.002s
  + EB-2c block-less events in a MIXED batch keep their numbered line (per-event reminder wrapper) 0.002s
  + EB-3 immediateEventMessage: no blocks ⇒ Left verbatim; blocks ⇒ Right(Text + blocks) 0.0s
