nebflow.agent.DelegateTtlCleanupSpec:
  + A · 收殓零重播: an ancient restart-lost row (failed ∧ fingerprint ∧ 9d old) never re-enters the revival/salvage视野 — zero revival, zero salvage, zero mailbox notice, row untouched 0.277s
  + B · 合成零重播: an ancient terminal row falling inside a long-downtime reconcile window is never synthesized into the parent mailbox 0.27s
  + C · 收尾零重播: an ancient completed-but-unreported row is never auto-closed/delivered by the boot sweep 0.232s
  + D · 边界三态: 6d23h59m kept, exactly 7d expired, 7d+1m expired — and a 100d-old RUNNING row is NEVER expired (in-flight red line) 0.002s
  + E · 锚解析: saved-state anchors (frozen/standby) win over the task row; owner-gone falls back to cancel marker then createdAt 0.001s
  + F · 清理面: expired dead entries are cleaned (row pruned + record removed), fresh ones and in-flight sessions are never touched 0.226s
  + G · 保存态清理: a frozen delegate parked 8d ago is swept at the record level; a fresh parked one is kept 0.211s
  + H · worktree 联动回收: expired-terminal leg recycles the tree; unmerged commits keep the branch (zero-ahead still guards branch deletion) 0.508s
  + I · 单源: DelegateTerminalTtl.TtlMs == Defaults.DelegateTerminalTtlMs == 7d; freeze retention derives from the same point 0.001s
