nebflow.agent.AskConcurrencyReworkSpec:
  + ② 正控：CleanupForSession(reason=turn-interrupted) 回收该 sourceSession 的槽并广播带 reason 的 askUserClosed 0.029s
  + ② 负控：来源死亡路（reason 缺省）帧逐字节不变 + 只回收该 sourceSession，不误伤邻居 0.055s
  + ③ 正控：ListAllPendingAsks 跨 root 一次性返回全部仍 pending 的 ask（按创建序） 0.056s
  + ③ 负控：按会话 ListPendingAsks 仍只返回本 root（不串扰、零回归） 0.03s
  + ⑥ 正控：形态不符的答复 → 广播 interactionAnswerRejected(reason=shape-mismatch) 且卡片保留、随后仍可正常作答 0.029s
  + ⑥ 负控：形态正确的答复不产生任何 rejected 帧（防「每次答复都弹提示」） 0.21s
  + ⑥ 正控：未知 requestId 的答复 → 广播 interactionAnswerRejected(reason=unknown-request-id) 0.059s
nebflow.agent.KernelAskLabelSpec:
  + kernel session discriminator is the delegate-kernel- prefix (same key as the audit filter) 0.001s
  + label = 'subagent · <description>' and NEVER the bare agent name 0.001s
  + short description is used verbatim; distinct tasks give distinct labels (multi-card discernibility) 0.0s
  + blank/absent description falls back to the session suffix (never an empty label) 0.001s
  + exactly-24-char summary is not truncated; 25 chars gets the ellipsis 0.0s
nebflow.agent.CancelProbeSpec:
  + IO.never fiber cancel completes immediately 0.001s
  + fs2 Stream.never compile cancel completes 0.001s
  + fs2 never through simple pipe cancel completes 0.0s
