nebflow.agent.AskUserDualModeRuntimeSpec:
  + root 非阻塞: 发起即返回（ack 进工具结果）+ 卡片渲染 + 槽位 +1 + 不标 WaitingForUser + 答复回投唤醒新 turn 0.381s
  + 全量非阻塞（真实 actor）: 执行 agent（nebflow）节点 depth=1 照常提问 ⇒ 零拒绝 + 占槽位 + 无 WaitingForUser + turn 未挂起 0.271s
  + 全量非阻塞（真实 actor）: 执行 agent 的 plain depth=1 形态同上（非 flowNodeSession 会话不再被拒） 0.292s
  + 裁④ 无预检: root 会话窗口未注册 ⇒ 不再拒绝，问题照常派发并可挂 pending 承接 0.261s
  + 退役参数: 调用面携带 `mode` ⇒ 可判读 ToolError + 零槽位 + 无卡片 + turn 未挂起 0.243s
  + 无等待态（真实 actor）: 非阻塞派发后 map 不出现 WaitingForUser，且第二轮 LLM 调用照常发生 0.251s
  + 请求体口径: 两身份的 LlmRequest.tools 里 AskUserQuestion 段与注册表基线逐字节一致（无 schema 变体残留） 0.419s
nebflow.gateway.UserFaceProcessStateSealSpec:
  + floor: the sealed faces exist (a missing tree is a vacuous green) 0.013s
  + locales define neither sealed key (retirement comments may still name them) 0.006s
  + the delivered web tree carries zero process-alert copy tokens 0.397s
  + the render faces no longer read the process states 0.001s
  + the terminal-failure hint survives (retry-exhausted stays user-visible) 0.002s
nebflow.gateway.PluginAssetsRoutesSpec:
  + rejects unauthenticated requests 0.352s
  + rejects a token query param (the rail is retired — any token value) 0.003s
  + the retired token query rail is refused even with the LIVE file token (stage D) 0.002s
  + the retired legacy nebflow_token cookie rail is refused even with the LIVE file token (stage D) 0.004s
  + serves a file via the session cookie 0.174s
  + serves nested paths 0.004s
  + uniform 404 for an unknown (or blocked) plugin — no existence oracle 0.003s
  + 404s for a missing file inside a known plugin 0.002s
  + rejects traversal segments 0.002s
  + encoded-backslash attempts never reach the filesystem (segments stay encoded, like /agents/) 0.002s
  + rejects wrong path shape: no rel segment / trailing slash 0.002s
  + symlink escape inside the package is refused (realpath containment final defense) 0.002s
  + production mount: Router("/api") serves the /api-prefixed frontend probe URL (404 seam pin) 0.005s
  + production mount对照: the bare (unprefixed) direct-call form still serves — neither leg may regress 0.002s
  + production mount: a prefixed request reaches the route — bad token is 403, never a silent fall-through 404 0.002s
  + production mount: unknown plugin keeps the uniform 404 (no existence oracle) on the prefixed form 0.002s
nebflow.gateway.BgWaitingCountSpec:
  + S1 有在飞后台任务 ⇒ bgWaitingCount=N 且明细（id+描述+startedAt）随行 0.006s
  + S2 无在飞任务 ⇒ bgWaitingCount=0（与 bgWaiting 空数组恒一致） 0.0s
  + S3 健康写缝激活后 ⇒ 快照行 health 与账本行同源（suspect/escalated 逐字一致） 0.001s
