nebflow.gateway.GatewayAuthSpec:
  + wrong ?token= + valid session cookie => ViaSession (WsAuth), never a rejection 0.001s
  + the same shape under ApiFull (RestApiCtx.checkAuth contract) authenticates 0.001s
  + a valid ?token= no longer authenticates (rail retired), even with a stale session cookie 0.0s
  + a valid legacy nebflow_token cookie no longer authenticates (rail retired) 0.0s
  + only ?token= (valid): every face refuses — the param rail is retired (stage D) 0.001s
  + only legacy nebflow_token cookie (valid): every face refuses — the legacy cookie rail is retired (stage D) 0.001s
  + only session cookie (valid): every session-carrying set accepts; BearerFileOnly refuses (R1-1 pin) 0.001s
  + only Bearer file token: ApiFull/WsAuth/OpenAiCompat/BearerFileOnly accept; StaticAuth refuses and falls through 0.0s
  + only an INVALID PAT: falls through everywhere (positive PAT needs JWKS = integration face) 0.001s
  + StaticAuth: an invalid Bearer does not short-circuit, and the retired param rail stays dead 0.0s
  + priority INSIDE the Bearer rail: a valid file token wins regardless of PAT validity, and vice versa 0.001s
  + origin matrix (param rail): refused from EVERY origin and mark (rail retired) 0.0s
  + origin matrix (legacy rail): refused from EVERY origin and mark (rail retired) 0.001s
  + tunnel origin still authenticates via session and Bearer rails (origin-blind by design) 0.0s
  + local-ticket ON a loopback leg (v4/v6/mapped) authenticates on every session-carrying face 0.003s
  + local-ticket OFF-leg (tunnel-None / LAN / public) refuses the session rail on every face 0.001s
  + local-ticket refusal composes with fall-through: off-leg cookie + valid Bearer => ViaBearer 0.0s
  + the binding is origin-class-scoped: relay-mint keeps authenticating on EVERY leg 0.001s
  + localTicketOnLeg predicate: loopback leg opens, tunnel/LAN/public legs refuse; relay-mint is exempt 0.0s
  + rotate: the OLD file token stops authenticating; the live session keeps working 0.001s
  + rail names are exactly session/bearer; the header name is brand-derived 0.0s
nebflow.gateway.TextStreamSearchSpec:
  + hits carry the exact 1-based byte line and column 0.004s
  + a match straddling a chunk seam is still found (held-back tail) 0.001s
  + line numbers stay exact when the newline itself straddles a seam 0.0s
  + case folding: insensitive by default, exact when caseSensitive 0.0s
  + maxHits caps the scan and reports truncation explicitly (never silent) 0.001s
  + no hit ⇒ zero hits, full scan, not truncated (the negative case) 0.0s
  + literal, not regex: metacharacters match themselves; overlapping matches each count 0.0s
  + a single-line file: hits still get exact columns and the echo stays bounded 0.002s
  + CRLF and an invalid-UTF-8 byte before the match do not shift line/col 0.0s
  + draining is incremental — frames never repeat hits 0.0s
  + an empty query is rejected at construction (the route layer reports it as an error frame) 0.0s
