  + state A1 close-frame: slot is released immediately, peer removed, no zombie verdict 0.008s
  + state A2 wire: peer ping is answered with pong on the send line 0.007s
  + state B heartbeat-timeout: silent half-open zombie is recycled, slot re-admits 0.155s
  + healthy peer answering pings is never recycled; its later close still releases 0.404s
  + heartbeat ping still flows on the send line (existing cadence unchanged) 0.058s
nebflow.gateway.SessionStoreRecoverAuthoritySpec:
